            <p>Trains from Boston arrive at Bridgeport Station, located at 525 Water Street in downtown Bridgeport, Connecticut.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Location:</b> Directly in the heart of Bridgeport's downtown district, near the waterfront and major city attractions.</li>
                <li><b>Connectivity:</b> Metro-North Railroad New Haven Line, Greater Bridgeport Transit Authority buses, taxis, and rideshare pick-up zones.</li>
